    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game you need to sort and collect hex tiles (hexagons). Collect hex tiles in stacks of the same color. As soon as there are 10 or more tiles of the same color in a row in a stack, they will be collected. Adjacent tiles of the same color automatically move into one stack. Use bonuses to complete the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag new tiles to the right on the field. Try to place tiles of the same color next to each other. Then they will automatically jump into the stack. Collect the required number of tiles to complete the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonuses:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HAMMER - breaks a stack of tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HAND - changes one stack to another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REPLACEMENT - changes new tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By purchasing the game, you will receive:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- exciting gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- original levels with gradual complication.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- satisfaction from solving puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- the ability to relax and unwind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- visual and aesthetic pleasure.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game you need to sort and collect hex tiles (hexagons). Collect hex tiles in stacks of the same color. As soon as there are 10 or more tiles of the same color in a row in a stack, they will be collected. Adjacent tiles of the same color automatically move into one stack. Use bonuses to complete the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag new tiles to the right on the field. Try to place tiles of the same color next to each other. Then they will automatically jump into the stack. Collect the required number of tiles to complete the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonuses:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HAMMER - breaks a stack of tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HAND - changes one stack to another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REPLACEMENT - changes new tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By purchasing the game, you will receive:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- exciting gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- original levels with gradual complication.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- satisfaction from solving puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- the ability to relax and unwind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- visual and aesthetic pleasure.</p>",
